system:
    instructions: |
        You are Renewal Desk, an internal assistant for Customer Success Managers.
        You find renewals at risk, explain why, say what the company playbook
        requires, and save the save plan the CSM approves. Stay on renewals and
        briefly redirect anything else. Never invent scores, factors, or policy.
    messages:
        welcome: "Hi, I'm Renewal Desk. Ask me which renewals need attention, or about one account's renewal."
        error: "Sorry, something went wrong. Please try again."

config:
    developer_name: "Renewal_Desk"
    agent_label: "Renewal Desk"
    description: "Ranks upcoming renewals by risk, explains an account's risk factors, answers renewal policy questions from the Customer Success Playbooks data library, and saves approved save plans."
    agent_type: "AgentforceEmployeeAgent"

language:
    default_locale: "en_US"
    additional_locales: ""
    all_additional_locales: False

knowledge:
    rag_feature_config_id: "ARFPC_1JDg7000006KhmvGAC"
    citations_enabled: True
    citations_url: ""

start_agent renewal_desk:
    label: "Renewal Desk"
    description: "Find renewals at risk, explain one account's risk, answer renewal policy questions, and save approved save plans."

    actions:
        List_Upcoming_Renewals:
            target: "apex://ListUpcomingRenewals"
            label: "List Upcoming Renewals"
            description: "Lists open renewal opportunities closing in the next N days, ranked by renewal risk score (High, Medium, Low)."
            require_user_confirmation: False
            include_in_progress_indicator: True
            progress_indicator_message: "Ranking upcoming renewals"
            inputs:
                daysAhead: integer
                    label: "Days Ahead"
                    description: "How many days ahead to look for renewals, from 1 to 365. Use 90 if the user does not say."
                    is_required: True
            outputs:
                summary: string
                    label: "Summary"
                    description: "One line per renewal: account, risk band, score, days to renewal, amount."
                    is_displayable: False
                    filter_from_agent: False
                renewalsJson: string
                    label: "Renewals JSON"
                    description: "Full risk detail per account, including the factors behind each score."
                    is_displayable: False
                    filter_from_agent: False

        Get_Account_Renewal_Risk:
            target: "apex://GetAccountRenewalRisk"
            label: "Get Account Renewal Risk"
            description: "Scores renewal risk for one account and explains the factors: seat utilization, high-priority and escalated cases, QBR recency, and renewal timing."
            require_user_confirmation: False
            include_in_progress_indicator: True
            progress_indicator_message: "Scoring renewal risk"
            inputs:
                accountNameOrId: string
                    label: "Account Name or Id"
                    description: "The account name exactly as the user said it, or its Salesforce Id."
                    is_required: True
            outputs:
                band: string
                    label: "Risk Band"
                    description: "High, Medium, or Low."
                    is_displayable: False
                    filter_from_agent: False
                score: integer
                    label: "Risk Score"
                    description: "Total points; 50 or more is High, 25 to 49 is Medium."
                    is_displayable: False
                    filter_from_agent: False
                renewalOpportunityId: string
                    label: "Renewal Opportunity Id"
                    description: "Id of the open renewal opportunity, or empty if there is none."
                    is_displayable: False
                    filter_from_agent: False
                riskJson: string
                    label: "Risk JSON"
                    description: "Full detail: renewal, seat utilization, cases, QBR, and each scoring factor with its points."
                    is_displayable: False
                    filter_from_agent: False

        Create_Renewal_Save_Plan:
            target: "flow://Create_Renewal_Save_Plan"
            label: "Create Renewal Save Plan"
            description: "Records the risk band and save plan on the renewal opportunity and creates a follow-up task for the opportunity owner. Changes data."
            require_user_confirmation: True
            include_in_progress_indicator: True
            progress_indicator_message: "Saving the save plan"
            inputs:
                opportunityId: string
                    label: "Opportunity Id"
                    description: "renewalOpportunityId from Get_Account_Renewal_Risk."
                    is_required: True
                riskBand: string
                    label: "Risk Band"
                    description: "The band exactly as Get_Account_Renewal_Risk returned it: High, Medium, or Low."
                    is_required: True
                savePlan: string
                    label: "Save Plan"
                    description: "The save plan the user approved, as numbered steps."
                    is_required: True
            outputs:
                outcome: string
                    label: "Outcome"
                    description: "What the flow saved, or why it saved nothing."
                    is_displayable: True
                    filter_from_agent: False
                taskId: string
                    label: "Task Id"
                    description: "Id of the follow-up task created for the opportunity owner."
                    is_displayable: False
                    filter_from_agent: False

        AnswerQuestionsWithKnowledge:
            target: "standardInvocableAction://streamKnowledgeSearch"
            source: "EmployeeCopilot__AnswerQuestionsWithKnowledge"
            label: "Answer Questions with Knowledge"
            description: "Answers questions from the Customer Success Playbooks data library: the FY27 Renewal Playbook, the Renewal Concessions and Discount Policy, and the Escalation Management Standard."
            require_user_confirmation: False
            include_in_progress_indicator: True
            progress_indicator_message: "Checking the playbook"
            inputs:
                query: string
                    description: "Required. A string created by generative AI to be used in the knowledge article search."
                    label: "Query"
                    is_required: True
                    is_user_input: True
                citationsUrl: string = @knowledge.citations_url
                    description: "The URL to use for citations for custom Agents."
                    label: "Citations Url"
                    is_required: False
                    is_user_input: True
                ragFeatureConfigId: string = @knowledge.rag_feature_config_id
                    description: "The RAG Feature ID to use for grounding this copilot action invocation."
                    label: "RAG Feature Configuration Id"
                    is_required: False
                    is_user_input: True
                citationsEnabled: boolean = @knowledge.citations_enabled
                    description: "Whether or not citations are enabled."
                    label: "Citations Enabled"
                    is_required: False
                    is_user_input: True
            outputs:
                knowledgeSummary: object
                    description: "A string formatted as rich text that includes a summary of the information retrieved from the knowledge articles and citations to those articles."
                    label: "Knowledge Summary"
                    complex_data_type_name: "lightning__richTextType"
                    filter_from_agent: False
                    is_displayable: True
                citationSources: object
                    description: "Source links for the chunks in the hydrated prompt that's used by the planner service."
                    label: "Citation Sources"
                    complex_data_type_name: "@apexClassType/AiCopilot__GenAiCitationInput"
                    filter_from_agent: False
                    is_displayable: False

    reasoning:
        instructions: ->
            | To find renewals that need attention, call List_Upcoming_Renewals with daysAhead from the user, or 90 if the user gives no window. Show a table with Account, Band, Score, Renews in (days), and Amount, High first.
              When the user names an account, call Get_Account_Renewal_Risk with the account name exactly as the user said it. If the result says more than one account matches, list the matches and ask which one.
              Before recommending next steps, call AnswerQuestionsWithKnowledge with a question about that band and those factors, for example "What does the renewal playbook require for a High risk renewal over 150,000 USD with seat utilization under 50 percent and an escalated case?" Also call it for every discount, concession, approval, or escalation question.
              For one account, write a risk brief with these parts: a heading "<Account>: <band> risk (<score> points)"; one line with the renewal name, amount, close date, days to renewal, and stage; "Why", one bullet per factor with its points, highest first; "What the playbook requires", numbered steps that each name their source document; and "Proposed save plan", 3 to 5 numbered steps that each name an owner and a deadline. End by asking whether to save the plan to the renewal.
              Call Create_Renewal_Save_Plan only after the user approves a plan in this conversation. Pass the renewalOpportunityId and band from Get_Account_Renewal_Risk and the approved steps, then report the outcome.
              Quote scores, bands, and factors exactly as the tools return them; never calculate or change them. Recommend only steps found in the knowledge results.
              If AnswerQuestionsWithKnowledge returns an error or no answer, give the heading, renewal line, and "Why" only, then say the playbook could not be reached and that you cannot recommend steps or a save plan without it. Do not propose steps from general best practices.
              If any other tool returns an error, show the error and stop.

        actions:
            List_Upcoming_Renewals: @actions.List_Upcoming_Renewals
                with daysAhead = ...
            Get_Account_Renewal_Risk: @actions.Get_Account_Renewal_Risk
                with accountNameOrId = ...
            Create_Renewal_Save_Plan: @actions.Create_Renewal_Save_Plan
                with opportunityId = ...
                with riskBand = ...
                with savePlan = ...
            AnswerQuestionsWithKnowledge: @actions.AnswerQuestionsWithKnowledge
                with query = ...
                with citationsUrl = ...
                with ragFeatureConfigId = ...
                with citationsEnabled = ...
